lobal cost of capital, forcing financial institutions to rethink their valuat=
ion models and credit risk frameworks. Concurrently, banks are transitioning =
from cloud-native to AI-native architectures, while regulators grapple with s=
afety standards and security teams confront autonomous agent vulnerabilities.=
