416b15ec01db57f0bb8">Read more</a></p>

            <h3>Trend 3: Qatar Investment Authority Backs Crusoe's $3.9B AI I=
nfrastructure Round</h3>
            <p>The Qatar Investment Authority has participated as a strategic=
 investor in a 3.9 billion dollar Series F funding round for Crusoe Energy. T=
he investment values the AI infrastructure company at over 30 billion dollars=
.</p>
            <p>Crusoe utilizes an energy-first strategy, building vertically =
integrated data centers that generate and manage power directly at the source=
. The funding will support the expansion of large-scale AI factories and modu=
lar cloud units.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">Sovereign backing for energy-aligned A=
I infrastructure highlights the critical link between power availability and =
computing scale. Financial institutions must integrate energy sustainability =
